<html>
<head>
    <title>Comments</title> 
</head>
<body>  
    <!-- This is a comment in HTML. Comments are not displayed in the browser and are used to leave notes for developers. -->
    <h1>Understanding Comments in HTML</h1>
    <p>Comments can be very useful for explaining your code or leaving reminders for yourself or other developers.</p>
    
    <!-- You can also use comments to temporarily disable code without deleting it. -->
    <!-- <p>This paragraph is commented out and will not be displayed.</p> -->
</body>
</html> 
